WEBVTT

00:00:00.644 --> 00:00:02.574
By the way, why do we have reserved seats?

00:00:02.574 --> 00:00:05.214
The Chief's doing, because you're with me.

00:00:05.214 --> 00:00:08.144
It was all I could do to keep him
from reserving the whole train.

00:00:08.144 --> 00:00:10.744
We could do general seating and
then split the difference...

00:00:12.254 --> 00:00:14.684
Then it'd be more cramped
and we'd get shoved closer.

00:00:14.684 --> 00:00:16.454
Huh?
I was really looking forward
to having you to myself today.

00:00:16.454 --> 00:00:18.824
I was really looking forward
to having you to myself today.

00:00:18.824 --> 00:00:19.264
When do I ever get to go to my home
town with just the two of us!

00:00:19.264 --> 00:00:23.594
Huh?! This is exactly like last episode, isn't it?
When do I ever get to go to my home
town with just the two of us!

00:00:23.594 --> 00:00:24.794
Huh?! This is exactly like last episode, isn't it?

00:00:24.864 --> 00:00:27.504
To everyone who's freaking out now, just relax.

00:00:27.504 --> 00:00:30.804
While all that excitement
was happening in Kyoto,

00:00:30.804 --> 00:00:33.204
there was other stuff happening back in Tokyo.

00:00:34.644 --> 00:00:36.704
Today, we'll be covering that angle.

00:00:36.874 --> 00:00:39.104
So, lets get started!

00:00:43.514 --> 00:00:50.614
Tsuyoku ririshiku habataite

00:00:51.624 --> 00:00:57.494
Zettai Karen Children

00:00:59.934 --> 00:01:05.734
Anata to koushite deaeta no wa

00:01:06.074 --> 00:01:10.944
Tada ikiteiku tame nanka ja nai

00:01:12.214 --> 00:01:17.744
Chiisai na chikai wa toki wo koete

00:01:18.154 --> 00:01:22.744
Mirai wo kanarazu kaeru yo

00:01:23.354 --> 00:01:26.264
Limiter (changing myself)

00:01:26.264 --> 00:01:29.384
Tokihaneteba (changing yourself)

00:01:29.534 --> 00:01:35.264
Hotobashiru tenshi no shining

00:01:36.704 --> 00:01:39.274
Sekai wo sukuu "tsubasa"

00:01:39.274 --> 00:01:42.104
Ima watashi ga eranda michi

00:01:42.344 --> 00:01:48.504
Yume wo tsukamitai dakedo (Tomaranai)

00:01:48.644 --> 00:01:51.454
Ataerareta chikara ga

00:01:51.454 --> 00:01:54.084
Sora e karitateru yo

00:01:54.084 --> 00:01:59.824
Tsuyoku ririshiku habataite

00:02:00.164 --> 00:02:05.694
Zettai karen my wings

00:02:14.644 --> 00:02:15.444
32nd sense: "A Rare Treat!
Touch Me If You Can!"

00:02:15.444 --> 00:02:17.744
32nd sense: "A Rare Treat!
Touch Me If You Can!"
I wonder if Captain Kashiwagi is already here.

00:02:17.744 --> 00:02:18.644
I wonder if Captain Kashiwagi is already here.

00:02:20.344 --> 00:02:23.014
The reason I said okay to
babysitting The Children

00:02:23.014 --> 00:02:26.074
was to make her see I'm
a nice "big brother" type!

00:02:27.954 --> 00:02:28.384
There we go...

00:02:28.384 --> 00:02:29.354
Oh, Dr. Sakaki, you really love
children, don't you?
There we go...

00:02:29.354 --> 00:02:31.594
Oh, Dr. Sakaki, you really love
children, don't you?

00:02:31.594 --> 00:02:33.254
You're going to make such a good father!

00:02:34.264 --> 00:02:37.594
To be a good father,
I'm going to need a good mother.

00:02:37.594 --> 00:02:39.704
For example... Yes.

00:02:39.704 --> 00:02:41.734
Someone like you.

00:02:41.734 --> 00:02:44.224
Oh, Dr. Sakaki!

00:02:45.334 --> 00:02:47.434
Or whatever!

00:02:52.174 --> 00:02:53.444
Hey, there!

00:02:53.984 --> 00:02:58.144
Dr. Sakaki! Take care of Kaoru and Shiho!

00:03:00.454 --> 00:03:02.384
We apparently underpredicted
how much help we'd need

00:03:02.384 --> 00:03:04.854
to cover the vandalism plot
against world heritage sites!

00:03:05.294 --> 00:03:09.254
If you need to, use that mobile phone
to release their limiters!

00:03:10.494 --> 00:03:12.654
See you! I leave this in your hands.

00:03:20.844 --> 00:03:22.244
What's the point?

00:03:22.244 --> 00:03:27.284
I finally get leave, so why do I have to
babysit these totally uncute little brats?

00:03:27.284 --> 00:03:28.944
Shut up, Dr. Sakaki! You're distracting me!

00:03:29.354 --> 00:03:31.584
Sure thing. I'll just shut up, then.

00:03:31.584 --> 00:03:33.954
Okay! I'll get you at the next corner!

00:03:40.264 --> 00:03:43.354
Yes! I broke through! GO!

00:03:46.234 --> 00:03:48.634
I did it! I did it!

00:03:48.634 --> 00:03:50.704
Oh, well. I lost.

00:03:50.704 --> 00:03:52.794
You sound happy about it.

00:03:54.074 --> 00:03:56.404
You lost to me on purpose just now, didn't you?

00:03:57.914 --> 00:04:00.714
N-No! Not at all!

00:04:01.384 --> 00:04:02.584
Really?

00:04:02.584 --> 00:04:05.274
Um... Er... Yeah...

00:04:08.084 --> 00:04:11.924
I don't like that! I don't like winning a fixed game!

00:04:11.924 --> 00:04:15.824
But if I play for real,
you always lose and get mad!

00:04:15.824 --> 00:04:18.264
It's natural to get mad when you lose!

00:04:18.264 --> 00:04:21.204
Sorry. But even with my limiter,

00:04:21.204 --> 00:04:26.074
I can't help reading your mind
when you get excited.

00:04:26.704 --> 00:04:28.864
Next game, I'll try a little harder.

00:04:32.374 --> 00:04:34.284
How can I play against a psychometrist?!

00:04:34.284 --> 00:04:35.474
Kaoru!
How can I play against a psychometrist?!

00:04:40.984 --> 00:04:42.144
Wh-What?

00:04:42.224 --> 00:04:44.854
Nothing. But the Level 7 who sees everything

00:04:44.854 --> 00:04:46.664
is still cute on the inside.

00:04:46.664 --> 00:04:48.184
What's that supposed to mean?

00:04:48.324 --> 00:04:50.434
At times like this, psychometrists like us

00:04:50.434 --> 00:04:53.864
have to be discrete about letting others
know when we're using our abilities.

00:04:54.504 --> 00:04:58.904
That was thoughtless to tell a friend
just how easily you could read her.

00:04:59.004 --> 00:05:01.164
You need to be a little more mature.

00:05:01.244 --> 00:05:03.814
Don't be so smug.

00:05:03.814 --> 00:05:06.984
Our relationship isn't that weak.

00:05:06.984 --> 00:05:08.644
You wouldn't understand, Doctor.

00:05:10.354 --> 00:05:13.084
Hey, hey! I just got a good idea!

00:05:13.524 --> 00:05:17.924
What if you competed against Dr. Sakaki?

00:05:17.994 --> 00:05:20.364
You can't play for real against me, right, Shiho?

00:05:20.364 --> 00:05:23.794
So, this time we'll have an even
match between psychometrists!

00:05:23.894 --> 00:05:26.454
Well? It'll be a ton of fun, right?

00:05:26.664 --> 00:05:28.194
Yeah...

00:05:28.664 --> 00:05:30.104
That could kill some time.

00:05:31.274 --> 00:05:35.264
Yeah, sure. Suppose I need to be
taking care of you kids, anyway.

00:05:47.084 --> 00:05:48.584
Mega Mega Race!

00:05:48.584 --> 00:05:50.024
Get ready!

00:05:50.724 --> 00:05:51.524
Go!

00:05:56.694 --> 00:05:59.134
Okay? You both have to play for real!

00:05:59.464 --> 00:06:01.434
And I'll give this to the winner as a prize!

00:06:01.934 --> 00:06:05.164
A cicada husk! An honest to God cicada!

00:06:05.634 --> 00:06:08.234
Have you kept that thing since last summer?

00:06:08.774 --> 00:06:10.374
Thank you, Kaoru.

00:06:10.374 --> 00:06:12.314
I don't want it, but I'll do my best.

00:06:12.444 --> 00:06:13.604
Yeah!

00:06:14.944 --> 00:06:16.754
There? You see?

00:06:16.754 --> 00:06:21.154
We're a lot closer than you think we are.
Mind your own business.

00:06:21.284 --> 00:06:24.654
That's a hell of a way to speak to an adult!

00:06:24.654 --> 00:06:26.024
Don't get carried away!

00:06:26.024 --> 00:06:30.054
Oh, I never said anything.
You're the one scanning me.

00:06:30.594 --> 00:06:33.534
Dammit! Not even half my age, and yet!

00:06:33.804 --> 00:06:37.794
Fine! Time to show you it's wrong to
spit on another person's concern!

00:06:44.244 --> 00:06:46.234
Ooh! Just as I expected!

00:06:46.384 --> 00:06:48.344
You're neck and neck on the straightaway!

00:06:50.554 --> 00:06:52.084
Who cares if you're Level 7?!

00:06:52.084 --> 00:06:55.684
I've got the higher level of life experience,
and I'm gonna bury you with it!

00:07:02.894 --> 00:07:03.794
What?!

00:07:03.934 --> 00:07:06.034
There she goes! The Lovely Jump!

00:07:06.034 --> 00:07:08.054
That's amazing!

00:07:08.864 --> 00:07:10.974
Pulling a high-level technique
out of the blue like that...

00:07:10.974 --> 00:07:11.104
ZUKYUUN!
Pulling a high-level technique
out of the blue like that...

00:07:11.104 --> 00:07:11.134
ZUKYUUN!

00:07:11.134 --> 00:07:14.004
ZUKYUUN!
Shiho! Did you scan the whole game?!

00:07:14.004 --> 00:07:14.234
ZUKYUUN!

00:07:14.444 --> 00:07:16.444
You're not going to distract me.

00:07:16.444 --> 00:07:20.034
So, that life experience of yours...
Is that the best you can do?

00:07:20.984 --> 00:07:24.414
You little brat! Now I'm pissed!

00:07:31.494 --> 00:07:35.394
Whoa! An immature, totally underhanded move!

00:07:51.874 --> 00:07:54.744
Winner, Shiho! Congratulations!

00:07:56.614 --> 00:07:59.844
Your prize is a kiss from the
race queen and a cicada shell!

00:08:01.484 --> 00:08:03.994
Thanks, but you can keep your cicada.

00:08:03.994 --> 00:08:06.754
Man, that battle made my hands sweat!

00:08:09.794 --> 00:08:12.764
That brat! Her personality's totally twisted!

00:08:13.004 --> 00:08:16.834
What's your problem? A Level 6, talking
like he can see everything in a person!

00:08:16.834 --> 00:08:19.644
I can't believe how Minamoto
dotes on these girls!

00:08:19.644 --> 00:08:23.114
Why is Mr. Minamoto friends
with a guy like this?

00:08:23.114 --> 00:08:27.144
All right! I'll take you down
a peg some other way!

00:08:27.144 --> 00:08:30.814
For the sake of the world, I'll educate you!

00:08:34.984 --> 00:08:38.324
This feels great! Shiho, come out here, too!

00:08:38.324 --> 00:08:40.424
Are you going to stay up there all day?

00:08:40.424 --> 00:08:43.084
The higher you are on a ship, the more it rocks!

00:08:43.734 --> 00:08:45.494
You'll be sorry if you get seasick!

00:08:45.494 --> 00:08:46.804
I'm fine! Just fine!

00:08:46.804 --> 00:08:48.354
Honestly...

00:08:52.634 --> 00:08:53.944
Why's he doing this?

00:08:53.944 --> 00:08:58.414
Most kids would be excited for this.
You're not very childlike.

00:08:58.414 --> 00:09:00.914
And you're not very mature.

00:09:00.914 --> 00:09:05.014
You lose a game, so now you want to
compete at fishing, which is your hobby?

00:09:10.994 --> 00:09:14.624
Okay, here we are! This is my secret spot.

00:09:14.624 --> 00:09:18.624
Word of warning: this time, I absolutely will win.

00:09:19.134 --> 00:09:20.634
This is your target!

00:09:20.634 --> 00:09:22.934
Any fish not on this chart is worth zero points!

00:09:22.934 --> 00:09:26.594
And our time limit will be precisely
determined by atomic clock!

00:09:27.344 --> 00:09:29.434
How immature can he get?

00:09:29.714 --> 00:09:33.114
I wonder what Aoi and
Mr. Minamoto are doing now?

00:09:33.714 --> 00:09:36.204
What am I doing here?

00:09:37.714 --> 00:09:40.824
It's tough, being left behind by
your teammate and Minamoto, huh?

00:09:40.824 --> 00:09:43.514
Sometimes, you have to get along
with people you aren't used to.

00:09:44.154 --> 00:09:47.894
There aren't many Normals like Minamoto.

00:09:47.894 --> 00:09:51.334
You're incredibly lucky to have
met him when you're only 10.

00:09:51.734 --> 00:09:53.204
That's not...

00:09:53.204 --> 00:09:56.164
Shall I show you how to fish before we start?

00:09:56.704 --> 00:09:58.034
No need.

00:09:59.234 --> 00:10:01.674
Sea bream pole... Three-point mechanism.

00:10:02.004 --> 00:10:05.844
Rod length: 6 meters.
Line length between 5 and 10.

00:10:06.244 --> 00:10:09.444
Cast float, three-way brass swivel.

00:10:09.614 --> 00:10:12.454
When its particular three-point cast is utilized,

00:10:12.454 --> 00:10:15.314
the line naturally stretches
from the float to the hook.

00:10:25.334 --> 00:10:27.194
Like this?

00:10:28.334 --> 00:10:31.874
Okay, you're on! Now you'll see my artistry!

00:10:31.874 --> 00:10:34.064
No more mister nice guy!

00:10:36.044 --> 00:10:37.374
Yeah! There we go!

00:10:39.514 --> 00:10:41.514
Fishing's kind of fun.

00:10:41.514 --> 00:10:43.284
There! I got a sea urchin!

00:10:43.284 --> 00:10:46.684
Didn't you say that was
worth zero points, Doctor?

00:10:47.254 --> 00:10:48.484
I know!

00:10:50.794 --> 00:10:52.894
Do your best, you two!

00:10:52.894 --> 00:10:55.584
I gotta win. I have to!

00:10:58.434 --> 00:10:59.794
That boat...

00:11:01.704 --> 00:11:03.534
We've arrived, Professor.

00:11:17.614 --> 00:11:20.244
My secret spot has people already fishing it?

00:11:21.024 --> 00:11:22.244
You!

00:11:24.594 --> 00:11:25.894
Trouble!

00:11:25.894 --> 00:11:28.394
The World Heritage Vandal
has appeared in Kyoto!

00:11:28.394 --> 00:11:31.594
Emergency scramble to all
special espers in the area!

00:11:31.594 --> 00:11:33.364
They'll never make it.

00:11:33.364 --> 00:11:36.104
More than that, our top priority now is...

00:11:36.104 --> 00:11:37.534
Understood.

00:11:37.604 --> 00:11:40.234
The Doubleface has been assigned that duty.

00:11:40.744 --> 00:11:42.604
Then we should go, too!

00:11:42.604 --> 00:11:43.164
Right.

00:11:43.274 --> 00:11:44.674
Director?

00:11:44.674 --> 00:11:46.644
Please wake up!

00:11:46.644 --> 00:11:49.634
Look! We have a limited-edition
makeup kit for you!

00:11:53.254 --> 00:11:55.524
Director, it's morning!

00:11:55.524 --> 00:11:57.854
Hey! Get up, already!

00:11:57.854 --> 00:11:59.924
I can't!

00:11:59.924 --> 00:12:02.484
Try first, then you can say that.

00:12:02.994 --> 00:12:05.564
Even saying that...

00:12:05.564 --> 00:12:08.464
Please take your work seriously!

00:12:08.464 --> 00:12:11.334
I'll bet you'll do fine without me.

00:12:11.334 --> 00:12:15.134
Wake up! Wake up! Wake up!

00:12:17.414 --> 00:12:20.014
Shaggy eyebrows!

00:12:23.154 --> 00:12:25.144
Shall I break it down for you?

00:12:27.354 --> 00:12:29.894
That's Sakaki, Prof. Saisen.

00:12:29.894 --> 00:12:32.424
Yeah... That arrogant little esper

00:12:32.424 --> 00:12:36.824
who resigned from our Touto
University surgical department.

00:12:36.964 --> 00:12:39.694
What an eyesore to have
this failure show up here!

00:12:41.664 --> 00:12:44.074
You know this guy, Doc?

00:12:44.074 --> 00:12:46.034
He said Touto University.

00:12:46.034 --> 00:12:48.374
I wouldn't even call him an acquaintance.

00:12:48.374 --> 00:12:50.274
I interned with him for three months and then

00:12:50.274 --> 00:12:52.904
left for Comerica when I saw
what a jackass he was.

00:12:53.744 --> 00:12:53.844
Professor Saisen is now making general rounds.

00:12:53.844 --> 00:12:55.984
TOUTO UNIVERSITY HOSPITAL
Professor Saisen is now making general rounds.

00:12:55.984 --> 00:12:57.384
TOUTO UNIVERSITY HOSPITAL

00:12:59.314 --> 00:13:01.884
Everyone in his gang was more concerned

00:13:01.884 --> 00:13:04.554
about success and
self-protection than medicine.

00:13:04.794 --> 00:13:09.164
Just a quick clairvoyant scan
told me the place was no good.

00:13:09.594 --> 00:13:12.834
Only good thing I learned from
him was about this fishing spot.

00:13:12.834 --> 00:13:14.604
You!

00:13:14.604 --> 00:13:17.194
How dare a filthy esper like you say that!

00:13:17.634 --> 00:13:19.274
You freak!

00:13:19.274 --> 00:13:20.674
What?!

00:13:20.774 --> 00:13:23.674
You got some nerve,
insulting espers in front of me!

00:13:23.674 --> 00:13:24.974
Kaoru!

00:13:24.974 --> 00:13:27.084
You wanna eat with the fishes?!

00:13:27.084 --> 00:13:30.074
No, I think you mean "sleep with the fishes."

00:13:31.084 --> 00:13:32.174
Why, you!

00:13:33.824 --> 00:13:36.154
Professor! Are you all right?

00:13:36.154 --> 00:13:37.144
We'll sue!

00:13:37.254 --> 00:13:39.624
Apologize to us first!

00:13:39.624 --> 00:13:41.764
Now what? Should I stop her?

00:13:41.764 --> 00:13:46.194
No. I've heard he supports
the Normal People, too.

00:13:46.294 --> 00:13:49.204
Maybe the world would be
better if his boat sank.

00:13:49.204 --> 00:13:54.264
Doc, release our limiters!
I won't let this guy insult espers!

00:13:57.614 --> 00:13:58.474
Kaoru!

00:13:58.474 --> 00:13:59.274
What's wrong?

00:14:00.944 --> 00:14:03.434
Uh-oh. She's got severe seasickness.

00:14:06.684 --> 00:14:09.554
You can't even keep your own
people healthy, can you?!

00:14:12.254 --> 00:14:13.594
Hey! Cut that out!

00:14:13.694 --> 00:14:14.464
Forget 'em!

00:14:14.464 --> 00:14:15.264
But!

00:14:15.264 --> 00:14:17.494
This comes first.

00:14:19.064 --> 00:14:22.594
Idiot! Idiot! Kiss my ass!

00:14:26.744 --> 00:14:27.704
Professor!

00:14:28.844 --> 00:14:30.774
What's wrong? Professor Saisen!

00:14:30.774 --> 00:14:33.004
Check his pulse! Is he conscious?

00:14:33.214 --> 00:14:35.244
What's their problem?

00:14:35.244 --> 00:14:38.054
No, that's nothing to laugh about.

00:14:38.054 --> 00:14:40.484
If they don't take care of him,
he may lose his life.

00:14:46.794 --> 00:14:47.624
There.

00:14:48.464 --> 00:14:50.464
I treated her. No worries.

00:14:50.464 --> 00:14:52.124
Thank goodness.

00:14:53.334 --> 00:14:54.564
Where're you going?

00:14:55.264 --> 00:14:56.534
To check on the old man.

00:14:56.534 --> 00:14:59.074
No! You should leave him alone!

00:14:59.074 --> 00:15:00.534
No, I can't.

00:15:00.804 --> 00:15:04.034
I'm not just an esper. I'm a doctor, too.

00:15:08.914 --> 00:15:11.344
Professor, please wake up.

00:15:13.684 --> 00:15:14.654
Why are you here?!

00:15:15.054 --> 00:15:16.574
We won't accept your help!

00:15:16.794 --> 00:15:20.054
We're the best the Touto surgical
department has to offer!

00:15:21.394 --> 00:15:23.694
So, what's your diagnosis?

00:15:24.964 --> 00:15:25.934
Ready, set...

00:15:26.904 --> 00:15:28.534
A cold!
His appendix!

00:15:28.534 --> 00:15:31.334
For crying out loud... Move!

00:15:34.844 --> 00:15:36.804
This is...

00:15:38.544 --> 00:15:40.204
A ruptured aneurysm?

00:15:40.514 --> 00:15:41.444
Yeah.

00:15:41.444 --> 00:15:42.844
I've called for a helicopter,

00:15:42.844 --> 00:15:44.954
but if we wait for it to arrive, it'll be too late.

00:15:44.954 --> 00:15:46.854
We'll perform emergency surgery here.

00:15:46.984 --> 00:15:48.254
Surgery?!

00:15:48.254 --> 00:15:50.224
We can't operate here!

00:15:50.224 --> 00:15:52.714
Better that than watching him die.

00:15:53.024 --> 00:15:55.924
Fortunately, I have equipment
on the BABEL boat.

00:15:58.894 --> 00:16:02.104
This is all the artificial blood
we have. Is it enough?

00:16:02.104 --> 00:16:05.304
If we use it with our ESP, it should be work.

00:16:05.304 --> 00:16:07.404
But I'm going to have to break

00:16:07.404 --> 00:16:11.204
a world surgical speed record
while stabilizing his body.

00:16:12.414 --> 00:16:15.044
So... Shiho?

00:16:15.044 --> 00:16:16.034
Assist me.

00:16:17.654 --> 00:16:18.584
Me?

00:16:18.584 --> 00:16:20.824
What are you talking about?!

00:16:20.824 --> 00:16:22.284
A child can't do surgery!

00:16:22.284 --> 00:16:25.624
She's no ordinary child!

00:16:26.894 --> 00:16:31.624
At the very least, I think she'll
do a better job than you two.

00:16:36.364 --> 00:16:38.234
Hey, if this fails, there'll be trouble!

00:16:38.234 --> 00:16:41.144
Better to let them take the blame, huh?

00:16:41.144 --> 00:16:44.544
And if it works, we'll say that we cured him.

00:16:44.544 --> 00:16:46.804
It's our ticket to success!

00:16:46.914 --> 00:16:48.034
Ready, set...

00:16:48.344 --> 00:16:51.014
We'll bet on your powers!

00:16:51.014 --> 00:16:53.344
Perfect synch this time.

00:16:53.454 --> 00:16:55.424
Dr. Sakaki.

00:16:56.624 --> 00:16:58.054
I...

00:16:58.054 --> 00:17:00.784
What will you do? Finally afraid?

00:17:01.664 --> 00:17:04.424
Well, I'm not gonna force a little kid
to do something they can't.

00:17:05.364 --> 00:17:07.854
Just release my limiter already!

00:17:09.134 --> 00:17:11.194
That's the spirit.

00:17:15.474 --> 00:17:18.074
Anyway, keep reading my thoughts

00:17:18.074 --> 00:17:20.584
and hand me the instrument
I need when I need it.

00:17:20.584 --> 00:17:21.514
Roger.

00:17:26.654 --> 00:17:28.644
Beginning surgery.

00:17:34.424 --> 00:17:36.194
Relax.

00:17:36.364 --> 00:17:39.954
You've seen stuff like this at accidents
and crime scenes before, right?

00:17:40.164 --> 00:17:41.924
I'm fine!

00:17:43.374 --> 00:17:47.404
Big difference between seeing it in your
mind and seeing it for real, huh?

00:17:47.404 --> 00:17:49.674
Even though you can learn everything
about something by clairvoyance,

00:17:49.674 --> 00:17:51.844
you see now that isn't enough.

00:17:51.844 --> 00:17:54.414
It doesn't compare with the real knowledge

00:17:54.414 --> 00:17:56.434
and experience one gains from age.

00:17:56.644 --> 00:17:59.154
Why do you keep needling me?!

00:17:59.154 --> 00:18:02.414
I can see fully well that you hate me!

00:18:03.054 --> 00:18:05.024
Just cut it out and concentrate on the surgery.

00:18:06.424 --> 00:18:08.294
You really are a kid, huh?

00:18:08.464 --> 00:18:09.824
I swear, if you say that again...

00:18:09.824 --> 00:18:12.164
It's not that I hate you.

00:18:13.034 --> 00:18:15.594
I envy you.

00:18:16.004 --> 00:18:20.004
How at age 10 you've met
your friends and Minamoto.

00:18:20.004 --> 00:18:23.334
I never had anyone to protect me.

00:18:27.184 --> 00:18:29.674
I was always, always...

00:18:31.014 --> 00:18:34.354
And then I met him.

00:18:34.454 --> 00:18:36.974
At the time, I thought...

00:18:37.124 --> 00:18:41.614
"Man, how can this guy ever
hope to understand me?"

00:18:42.264 --> 00:18:43.764
Do you see?

00:18:43.764 --> 00:18:46.534
Since Minamoto and the others protect you

00:18:46.534 --> 00:18:48.664
you get a chance to be a kid.

00:18:48.664 --> 00:18:51.364
What can be better than that?

00:18:59.074 --> 00:19:02.744
I... I understand that.

00:19:04.614 --> 00:19:08.314
And it's not like I scan everything.

00:19:11.324 --> 00:19:13.964
Nobody knows better than a psychometrist

00:19:13.964 --> 00:19:16.084
that sometimes ignorance is bliss.

00:19:18.764 --> 00:19:21.704
Shit. That's what bugs me about you.

00:19:21.704 --> 00:19:23.104
Now what?

00:19:23.104 --> 00:19:25.704
That whole jaded grownup act of yours!

00:19:25.704 --> 00:19:27.304
Then how should I act?

00:19:27.304 --> 00:19:28.874
Just shut up!

00:19:28.874 --> 00:19:30.814
I've been quiet this whole time!

00:19:30.814 --> 00:19:31.604
Be quiet!

00:19:31.714 --> 00:19:34.644
First of all, you sent your thoughts to me, right?

00:19:36.014 --> 00:19:38.884
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:19:42.054 --> 00:19:44.124
We're home!

00:19:44.124 --> 00:19:45.594
Welcome back!

00:19:45.594 --> 00:19:47.714
We brought back a ton of souvenirs!

00:19:48.024 --> 00:19:50.014
Welcome back!

00:19:52.464 --> 00:19:54.764
Wh-What are you doing?

00:19:56.704 --> 00:20:00.004
Cut the body into three layers to make sashimi.

00:20:00.004 --> 00:20:01.944
Just slice it like food...

00:20:01.944 --> 00:20:04.514
Now, for the remainder... Salt.

00:20:04.514 --> 00:20:05.914
Here.

00:20:06.674 --> 00:20:09.084
Ooh, it smells delicious!

00:20:09.084 --> 00:20:12.844
It'd be fine as is, but there's
a tastier way to eat it.

00:20:13.084 --> 00:20:16.024
Put kelp into a pot with
some sake to make a broth.

00:20:16.024 --> 00:20:18.394
Bring to a boil, then add your grilled bones.

00:20:18.394 --> 00:20:20.864
Finally, we add that tofu you
brought back from Kyoto,

00:20:20.864 --> 00:20:22.994
some potherb mustard, let the flavor penetrate,

00:20:22.994 --> 00:20:25.034
and our boiled tofu and sea bream is ready!

00:20:25.034 --> 00:20:26.494
Hooray!

00:20:26.494 --> 00:20:28.964
Oh, I can't wait!

00:20:28.964 --> 00:20:31.274
Culinary regeneration medicine!

00:20:31.274 --> 00:20:33.764
And then we add soumen noodles to finish it.

00:20:36.604 --> 00:20:38.114
Mm! This is great!

00:20:38.114 --> 00:20:39.444
Yes.

00:20:39.444 --> 00:20:42.144
I can really taste the pain and
suffering of the sea bream

00:20:42.144 --> 00:20:44.634
that were brutally killed
spreading through my mouth.

00:20:46.484 --> 00:20:48.154
It's very tasty.

00:20:48.154 --> 00:20:49.384
A demon?

00:20:51.924 --> 00:20:54.184
What's wrong, Sakaki?

00:20:56.764 --> 00:21:00.764
If I was 10 years old right now,
I'd be a member of The Children,

00:21:00.764 --> 00:21:03.664
and making trouble for you, too!

00:21:03.734 --> 00:21:05.964
You, one of The Children?

00:21:07.404 --> 00:21:08.604
The Children!

00:21:09.244 --> 00:21:10.434
Released!

00:21:11.444 --> 00:21:11.934
<<RELEASED>>

00:21:12.344 --> 00:21:14.174
You'd be dead wrong to think of us as little kids!

00:21:14.314 --> 00:21:16.714
Even without makeup,
we'll beat you hands down!

00:21:16.714 --> 00:21:19.054
We'll steal our way into your heart!

00:21:19.054 --> 00:21:21.054
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:21:21.054 --> 00:21:22.524
Ta-Dah!

00:21:23.854 --> 00:21:26.394
I wouldn't like that. It's kind of gross.

00:21:26.394 --> 00:21:28.794
Better to have all girls as partners, right?

00:21:28.794 --> 00:21:31.564
We get enough sexual harassment from Kaoru...

00:21:31.564 --> 00:21:34.064
Oh, come on! Wouldn't you let me in?

00:21:34.064 --> 00:21:36.264
Mr. Minamoto prefers girls, too.

00:21:37.334 --> 00:21:39.134
Yes, I knew it!

00:21:39.134 --> 00:21:40.334
Naughty boy!

00:21:42.474 --> 00:21:43.994
NO!

00:21:44.944 --> 00:21:48.644
Minamoto, you really are amazing. After all...

00:21:48.644 --> 00:21:51.584
Doctor, your job's done here.
Why don't you go home?

00:21:51.584 --> 00:21:53.514
You're just in the way now.

00:21:54.754 --> 00:21:56.354
Really amazing.

00:21:56.354 --> 00:22:00.124
How he can stand to be with these uncute brats!

00:22:01.294 --> 00:22:05.094
And thus we end this week's episode!

00:22:05.094 --> 00:22:07.694
See you, everyone!

00:22:21.414 --> 00:22:26.114
Kimi no tsuyogari wo gyuuto dakishimeta

00:22:26.114 --> 00:22:29.054
Setsunai yokogao sae zenbu

00:22:29.054 --> 00:22:31.424
I-TO-SHI-I

00:22:31.424 --> 00:22:35.624
Kabe wo kowasu tabi tsuyokunaru hito yo

00:22:35.624 --> 00:22:41.494
Boku no hitomi ni kurui wa nai

00:22:41.834 --> 00:22:46.804
Massugu sugiru mune no omoi

00:22:46.804 --> 00:22:50.374
Darenimo makenai kara

00:22:50.374 --> 00:22:55.614
Zettai kimi wo hanasanai donna toki mo

00:22:55.614 --> 00:23:00.824
Mada mienai LAST wa boku ga kaeyou

00:23:00.824 --> 00:23:05.154
Akuma mo tenshi nimo tsubasa ga aru

00:23:05.154 --> 00:23:10.794
Motto takai sora e to michibikou

00:23:10.794 --> 00:23:15.504
Kore ijou egao wo kumorasenai

00:23:15.504 --> 00:23:21.874
Tsunagaru kibou ga ima yami wo hikisaitara

00:23:21.874 --> 00:23:24.804
Kimi to tomo ni

00:23:25.044 --> 00:23:30.674
Tobikoeru ashita e Break Your Destiny

00:23:40.054 --> 00:23:40.994
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:41.124 --> 00:23:43.424
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.424 --> 00:23:46.954
It was our long-awaited hike,
and we all started early in high spirits.

00:23:47.304 --> 00:23:51.104
Akashi and the other two were
especially excited. And then...

00:23:51.174 --> 00:23:54.344
It was our first hike. And...

00:23:54.344 --> 00:23:56.834
There was something else Kaoru was
experiencing for the first time!

00:23:57.144 --> 00:23:58.504
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:58.674 --> 00:24:02.644
Episode 33: "Autumn Outing!
The Lunch Box Is In A Grove!"

00:24:02.644 --> 00:24:04.454
Which is to say, something happened.

00:24:04.454 --> 00:24:06.684
But I really didn't mean any harm!

00:24:06.854 --> 00:24:08.124
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.124 --> 00:24:08.954
Autumn Outing!
The Lunch Box Is In A Grove
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

